### =====================================================================
### Kraków bez barier — MVP e2e demo (VS Code "REST Client", humao.rest-client)
###
### 1. Start server:  uv run python main.py
### 2. Click "Send Request" above each block, top → bottom (requests pass ids along via @name).
### 3. Start again any time with step 0 (reset).
### =====================================================================

@base = http://localhost:8000/api/v1
@anna = demo-anna
@jan = demo-jan
@ola = demo-ola
@piotr = demo-piotr
@marek = demo-marek
@admin = demo-admin
@ewa = demo-ewa
@public = http://localhost:8000/public/v1
@apiKey = demo-key

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 0. Reset demo data (admin) → 204
POST {{base}}/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### Demo login (optional — demo tokens are just "demo-<username>") → 200 {token, user}
POST {{base}}/auth/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "anna"}

### Who am I → 200 role=user
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. Search step-free places → plc_mnk, plc_ice
GET {{base}}/places?features=step_free_entrance

### Feature dictionary (filters)
GET {{base}}/accessibility/features

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. Place details
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk

### 2b. Accessibility → elevator: yes (seed, confidence 0.5)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. Can I get in by wheelchair? → answer: yes
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=wheelchair

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4a. Anna uploads a photo → 201 {id: ph_…, url}
# @name upload
POST {{base}}/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DemoBoundary

------DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="winda.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./winda.png
------DemoBoundary--

### 4a-AI. AI suggestions for the photo → tags winda/awaria, suggested elevator / not_working / critical
### (AI_MODE=mock: deterministic; onnx: Phi-3.5 Vision, falls back to mock on error/timeout)
POST {{base}}/ai/image-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"photo_ids": ["{{upload.response.body.$.id}}"], "place_id": "plc_mnk"}

### 4b. Anna reports broken elevator → 201, observation_ids[0]
# @name report
POST {{base}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "place_id": "plc_mnk",
  "element": "elevator",
  "current_state": "not_working",
  "severity": "critical",
  "nature": "temporary",
  "description": "Winda przy wejściu głównym nieczynna, kartka o awarii.",
  "photo_ids": ["{{upload.response.body.$.id}}"]
}

### 4c. Elevator now: no, temporary, confidence 0.6
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### 4d. Active observations (alerts)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/observations?feature=elevator
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5a. Jan confirms 👍
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### 5b. Ola confirms 👍
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### 5c. Piotr confirms 👍 → feature_state.confidence 0.9
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{piotr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### 5d. Check → answer: partial (get in, elevator broken)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=wheelchair

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6a. Marek says the elevator works → 201, creates conflict
# @name marek
POST {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{marek}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"feature": "elevator", "value": "yes", "comment": "Winda działa, sprawdzone rano."}

### 6b. Elevator: still no, validation CONFLICT
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### 6c. Admin: moderation queue → 1 conflict item
# @name queue
GET {{base}}/admin/queue?filter=conflict
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### 6d. Admin: conflict detail (both observations, votes, photo)
GET {{base}}/admin/queue/{{queue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7a. Admin confirms Marek → status approved, elevator yes, confidence 1.0, VALID
POST {{base}}/admin/queue/{{queue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "confirm",
  "winning_observation_id": "{{marek.response.body.$.id}}",
  "comment": "Sprawdzone telefonicznie z muzeum."
}

### 7b. Check → answer: yes
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/check?profile=wheelchair

### 7c. History kept: Anna's observation REJECTED, not deleted (active=false shows all)
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/observations?feature=elevator&active=false

### =====================================================================
### F5 Open API (/public/v1) — external apps, X-Api-Key, 60 req/min per key
### =====================================================================

### P1. Public search step-free places → plc_mnk, plc_ice
GET {{public}}/places?features=step_free_entrance
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P2. Public place
GET {{public}}/places/plc_mnk
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P3. Flat accessibility (yes→true, no→false, unknown omitted); after 7a elevator = true
GET {{public}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P4. Flat accessibility, partial data → only "ramp"
GET {{public}}/places/plc_camelot/accessibility
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### P5. Public check → partial (ICE: elevator broken)
GET {{public}}/places/plc_ice/check?profile=wheelchair
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED — public API without key
GET {{public}}/places

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED — app Bearer token is not an API key
GET {{public}}/places
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### =====================================================================
### F7 Owner scenario — owner says "repaired" vs users "broken" (original mockup conflict)
### Starts with its own reset. Ewa (owner) owns plc_mnk + plc_camelot.
### =====================================================================

### O0. Reset → 204
POST {{base}}/admin/demo/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### O1. Owner: my places → plc_mnk, plc_camelot
GET {{base}}/owner/places
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}

### O2. Anna uploads photo → 201
# @name ownUpload
POST {{base}}/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DemoBoundary

------DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="winda.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./winda.png
------DemoBoundary--

### O3. Anna reports broken elevator (0.6) → 201
# @name ownReport
POST {{base}}/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "place_id": "plc_mnk", "element": "elevator", "current_state": "not_working",
  "severity": "critical", "nature": "temporary",
  "description": "Winda nieczynna.", "photo_ids": ["{{ownUpload.response.body.$.id}}"]
}

### O4a. Jan 👍
POST {{base}}/observations/{{ownReport.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{jan}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### O4b. Ola 👍
POST {{base}}/observations/{{ownReport.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{ola}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### O4c. Piotr 👍 → confidence 0.9
POST {{base}}/observations/{{ownReport.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{piotr}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### O5. Owner sees user reports on her places → Anna's report
GET {{base}}/owner/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}

### O6. Owner: "elevator repaired" → 201, source verified_owner, 0.85, validation CONFLICT
# @name ewaUpdate
POST {{base}}/owner/places/plc_mnk/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"observations": [{"feature": "elevator", "value": "yes", "comment": "Winda naprawiona 3.10, serwis potwierdził."}]}

### O7. State: elevator still no (users 0.9 > owner 0.85), CONFLICT
GET {{base}}/places/plc_mnk/accessibility

### O8. Admin queue → 1 conflict (owner vs users)
# @name ownQueue
GET {{base}}/admin/queue?filter=conflict
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}

### O9. Admin confirms owner → elevator yes, 1.0, VALID
POST {{base}}/admin/queue/{{ownQueue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "confirm", "winning_observation_id": "{{ewaUpdate.response.body.$.items[0].id}}"}

### O10. Admin assigns Marek as owner of ICE → 200, role owner
POST {{base}}/admin/places/plc_ice/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "usr_marek"}

### O11. Marek (now owner) sees ICE
GET {{base}}/owner/places
Authorization: Bearer {{marek}}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — regular user on owner panel
GET {{base}}/owner/places
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — owner updates a place she does not own
POST {{base}}/owner/places/plc_ice/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"observations": [{"feature": "elevator", "value": "yes"}]}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — non-admin assigns owner
POST {{base}}/admin/places/plc_ice/owner
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id": "usr_ewa"}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — empty owner batch
POST {{base}}/owner/places/plc_mnk/observations
Authorization: Bearer {{ewa}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"observations": []}

### =====================================================================
### Error paths (expected status in title)
### =====================================================================

### 404 NOT_FOUND — unknown place
GET {{base}}/places/nope

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — unknown feature in filter
GET {{base}}/places?features=teleporter

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED — report without token
POST {{base}}/reports
Content-Type: application/json

{"place_id": "plc_mnk", "element": "ramp", "current_state": "works", "severity": "minor", "nature": "permanent", "description": "x"}

### 401 UNAUTHORIZED — unknown demo user
POST {{base}}/auth/demo
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "daniel"}

### 403 FORBIDDEN — non-admin opens queue
GET {{base}}/admin/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — author votes on own observation (run after 4b)
POST {{base}}/observations/{{report.response.body.$.observation_ids[0]}}/votes
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"value": 1}

### (setup for next case) upload a "screenshot" → 201
# @name screenshot
POST {{base}}/uploads
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----DemoBoundary

------DemoBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="screenshot.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./winda.png
------DemoBoundary--

### 400 NOT_A_REAL_PLACE — AI rejects a screenshot
POST {{base}}/ai/image-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"photo_ids": ["{{screenshot.response.body.$.id}}"]}

### 400 VALIDATION_ERROR — AI with unknown photo
POST {{base}}/ai/image-tags
Authorization: Bearer {{anna}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"photo_ids": ["ph_missing"]}

### 409 CONFLICT — decide twice on the same item (run after 7a)
POST {{base}}/admin/queue/{{queue.response.body.$.items[0].id}}/decision
Authorization: Bearer {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"action": "reject"}
